ink-new-window">Complete DSMZ Media List</a></td></tr><tr><td>Summary and <br />additional information: </td><td><- B. Schink, Eberhard-Karls-Universität Tübingen, Tübingen, Germany; KoMAc1 <- B. Schuppert; {1988}. Anoxic sewage sludge. Germany (4087), Tübingen. Taxonomy/description (4087). Sequence accession no. 16S  rRNA gene: PX251121. (Medium 194 with strain-specific modifications, 30°C, anaerobic)</td></tr><tr><td>Literature: </td><td><a href="https://www.dsmz.de/research/publications/4087" onclick="return nn_openWindow(this.href);" target="_blank" class="internal-link-new-window">4087</a></td></tr><tr><td>Risk group: </td><td>1 (provisional classification by DSMZ)</td></tr><tr><td>Supplied as: </td><td><table style="border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0;" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>Delivery form</td><td width="50">&nbsp;</td><td>Prices</td></tr><tr style="border:1px solid #CECECE" height="1"><td colspan="3"></td></tr><tr><td>Freeze Dried</td><td width="50">&nbsp;</td><td align="right">120,- &euro;</td></tr><tr><td>Active culture on request</td><td width="50">&nbsp;</td><td align="right">280,- &euro;</td></tr><tr><td>DNA</td><td width="50">&nbsp;</td><td align="right">180,- &euro;</td><td width="20">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3">Price Category for this culture: <b>1</b></td></tr></table><br />Freight and handling charges will be added.<a href="https://www.dsmz.de/?id=512" target="_blank" valign="top" class="external-link-new-window"> See price list.</a></td></tr><tr><td>Other cultures: </td><td><a href ="https://www.dsmz.de/search?tx_kesearch_pi1[sword]=Acetobacterium sp." class="internal-link">All DSMZ cultures of the species</a></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td><a onclick="javascript:window.print(); return false;" href="#" class="download">Print data sheet</a>  </td></tr></table>
